</tier><tier id="TIE1" speaker="SPK0" category="en" type="a" display-name="RAP [en]"><event start="T0" end="T5">Hello, today I found it absolutely neccessary to come speak to you about a topic • that occured to me the other day that is. </event>
<event start="T5" end="T13">• • Have you ever noticed (how), • sometimes, • • there's a given situation, • • and a person appears • • with a certain behaviour that is inconsistent • • with the situation that person is in! </event>
<event start="T13" end="T14">((laughs)) </event>
<event start="T15" end="T114">Now I forgot the topic I had. </event>
<event start="T114" end="T16">I don/ • don't remember the topic, • um, </event>
<event start="T17" end="T18">because I've been troubled. </event>
<event start="T18" end="T20">• • I've been troubled by the following. </event>
<event start="T20" end="T23">• • • It is very difficult • to find french fries that taste like french fries in this day and age. </event>
<event start="T23" end="T2">• • It is really difficult. </event>
<event start="T2" end="T29">• • There are french fries that taste like cheese, • • french fries that taste like onion, • • french fries that taste like ham, barbecue-flavoured french fries. </event>
<event start="T29" end="T33">• • But, um, finding french fries that taste like a good potato is very • • difficult. </event>
<event start="T33" end="T35">• • And then I questioned french fries with barbecue flavour, for example. </event>
<event start="T35" end="T95">No. </event>
<event start="T95" end="T96">• • No, no. </event>
<event start="T96" end="T36">• No, no way! </event>
<event start="T36" end="T38">• • No, because they don't say whether it's barbecued fish or barbecued meat, or whether it/ it's barbecued chicken. </event>
<event start="T38" end="T39">No, it's just barbecued. </event>
<event start="T39" end="T40">• Now, barbecue is a thing, um, in which you can grill things. </event>
<event start="T40" end="T42">• • Yes? </event>
<event start="T42" end="T44">• • And the potatoes taste like it. </event>
<event start="T44" end="T46">• • • Um, it's basically another of saying n/ potatoes with smoke flavour. </event>
<event start="T46" end="T47">• Um, potatoes that taste like smoke. </event>
<event start="T47" end="T48">• Put it on the grill, • and people will eat it. </event>
<event start="T48" end="T52">• • • And it's the same for a/ , • all food today, food that tastes like other food, • • everywhere, • • everywhere. </event>
<event start="T52" end="T92">• • • Uhm, • Water! </event>
<event start="T92" end="T55">• The water of today, uhm, • water • with strawberry flavour. </event>
<event start="T55" end="T94">• No! </event>
<event start="T94" end="T56">• • No! </event>
<event start="T56" end="T97">• • Not in the water! </event>
<event start="T97" end="T57">Listen up! </event>
<event start="T57" end="T58">• Water is only/ only a thing of the lords of the water. </event>
<event start="T58" end="T61">• • • But well, • water, • • water. </event>
<event start="T61" end="T98">• • • Dictionary. </event>
<event start="T98" end="T63">• Water, • water. </event>
<event start="T63" end="T65">• • Colourless, transparent, tasteless and odourless liquid. </event>
<event start="T65" end="T64">This means you don't taste anything or smell anything. </event>
<event start="T64" end="T99">• Water with flavour? </event>
<event start="T99" end="T66">No! </event>
<event start="T66" end="T68">• • • Ah, but that type that comes with a flavour, isn't water. </event>
<event start="T68" end="T93">• • • This water tastes like what? </event>
<event start="T93" end="T70">Like nothing, it's water. </event>
<event start="T70" end="T100">• • • And with what flavour? </event>
<event start="T100" end="T101">Strawberry? </event>
<event start="T101" end="T72">That's not water! </event>
<event start="T72" end="T73">• • That's not water! </event>
<event start="T73" end="T74"> • • • Water with a flavour • • is not water. </event>
<event start="T74" end="T75">• • • Pft, • • it's not water! </event>
<event start="T75" end="T102">• • It's not water! </event>
<event start="T102" end="T103">• • It's not • water! </event>
<event start="T103" end="T76">• • Understood? </event>
<event start="T76" end="T78">• • • There's yoghurt today, for example, yoghurt that is chocolate-flavoured yoghurt • • with tabasco. </event>
<event start="T78" end="T3">• ((laughs)) </event>
<event start="T3" end="T104">Ah, sophistication, what sophistication, • spicy chocolate. </event>
